নে কী?","options":["শুভ যাত্রা!","দ্রুত আরোগ্য লাভ করুন!","শুভ জন্মদিন!"],"answer":1,"id":"a2-practice-25-q12"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„erkältet“ মানে কী?","options":["আহত","বীমা করা","ঠান্ডা লেগেছে"],"answer":2,"id":"a2-practice-25-q13"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich fahre mit ___ Fahrrad.","options":["dem","das","den"],"answer":0,"id":"a2-practice-25-q14"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Der Zug kommt ___ acht Uhr.","options":["im","um","am"],"answer":1,"explanation":"A1 মনে করুন: ঘড়ির সময় → um।","id":"a2-practice-25-q15"}],"requires":{"grammar":7,"vocabulary":21}},"schema":1,"id":"a2-practice-25","level":"A2","test":[]}